    "summary": "In the opponent’s Shooting phase, Mortarion may use Inflamed Reprisal while he has it. The trigger is an attack targeting one of your DEATH GUARD units no farther than 6″ from him. After the enemy resolves its attacks, the friendly target may fire back as in your Shooting phase. It can target only the attacker, if eligible, and worsens its Ballistic Skill by 1 for those attacks.",
